Land Information System, NASA Goddard Space Flight Center. examples/sgp_5d contains cropped NLDAS-2 forcing (NASA GES DISC) and the
Noah-MP parameter table NoahmpTable.TBL (NCAR Noah-MP, UCAR terms above).
